§ `s 10(13) the regular reason is not a reason mentioned in paragraphs 12(3)(a) to (f) (src:296-299)`
`ei1 test regular 10 weeks` MEANS `ei1 Special benefits paid for one reason` OF `a reason other than those mentioned in subsection 12(3)`, 10
#ASSERT count (`ei1 the special benefits actually paid` (LIST `ei1 test regular 10 weeks`, `ei1 test pregnancy 15 weeks`)) EQUALS 1
#ASSERT count (`ei1 the special benefits actually paid` (LIST `ei1 test regular 10 weeks`)) EQUALS 0
